        "text": "```python\ndef max_sub_array_sum(a, size):\n    if size == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    max_ending_here = a[0]\n    max_so_far = a[0]\n    \n    for i in range(1, size):\n        max_ending_here = max(a[i], max_ending_here + a[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n    \n    return max_so_far\n```",
